# The source distribution on PyPI: the package with its data and the viewer page, the tests (they fetch their two PDS
# products, see tests/conftest.py; many of them need the repository's scripts, docs and studies as well), and the
# documents a reviewer looks for. The studies, notebooks, Windows scripts, paper and documentation site stay in the
# git repository (https://github.com/ctate7163/rpp).
include LICENSE NOTICE README.md CHANGELOG.md CITATION.cff CONTRIBUTING.md CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md pyproject.toml
graft src/rpp/data
graft src/rpp/viewer
recursive-include tests *.py
graft tests/data
global-exclude __pycache__ *.py[cod] .DS_Store
prune studies
prune notebooks
prune paper
prune docs
prune scripts
prune envs
prune "Claude outputs"
